<section class="pet-safety-visual" aria-labelledby="pet-routes-title">
  <div class="pet-safety-head">
    <span class="pet-paw" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Pets & household scent</p><h2 id="pet-routes-title">Different animals, different routes of exposure</h2></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pet-routes">
    <article><svg viewBox="0 0 96 72" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 49c0-22 15-34 32-34 16 0 29 9 31 26l-9 13-19 8-20-4Z"/><path d="m30 25-4-15 14 9m24 1 12-11 1 18"/><circle cx="41" cy="37" r="2"/><circle cx="61" cy="37" r="2"/><path d="M49 46h6m-3 0v5"/></svg><h3>Air and airways</h3><p>Diffusers, sprays and scented products can add airborne droplets or vapours. Respiratory sensitivity and the exact product matter.</p></article>
    <article><svg viewBox="0 0 96 72" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M26 52c-11-4-13-16-6-25 7-10 22-12 31-4 9-8 24-6 31 4 7 9 5 21-6 25l-12 4H38Z"/><path d="M29 26 18 13l20 5m29 0 18-7-7 17"/><circle cx="40" cy="37" r="2"/><circle cx="62" cy="37" r="2"/><path d="M47 46q5 4 10 0"/><path d="M20 62h57"/></svg><h3>Coat, paws and grooming</h3><p>Liquid on fur, paws or skin can become an ingestion concern when an animal grooms. Keep spills and concentrates inaccessible.</p></article>
    <article><svg viewBox="0 0 96 72" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M48 58c17-13 23-27 17-43 14 8 21 21 15 36-5 14-17 19-32 7Z"/><path d="m66 24 12-8-5 15m-10 8 14 1-10 8"/><circle cx="67" cy="31" r="2"/><path d="M19 50c9-8 18-8 26 0M18 57c10-8 19-8 27 0"/></svg><h3>Species and formula vary</h3><p>Cats, dogs and birds do not process or respond to products in the same way. Concentration, dose and route are important.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .pet-safety-visual{margin:0 0 28px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:#fffaf3}.pet-safety-head{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center}.pet-safety-head h2{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25}.pet-paw{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:#f3e6d5;color:#805d40;font-size:19px}.pet-routes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}.pet-routes article{padding:13px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eee6dc}.pet-routes svg{display:block;width:70px;height:53px;margin-bottom:7px;fill:#f3e6d5;stroke:#506a5b;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.pet-routes h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}.pet-routes p{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:620px){.pet-safety-visual{padding:17px}.pet-safety-head h2{font-size:20px}.pet-routes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.pet-routes article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;column-gap:10px}.pet-routes svg{width:58px;height:47px;grid-row:span 2}.pet-routes h3{align-self:end}.pet-routes p{grid-column:2}}
</style>
